{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe struggle itself toward the heights is enough to fill a human\u2019s heart. One must imagine Sisyphus happy.\u201d</i> \u2013 Albert Camus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sisyphus, king of Corinth, has tricked the Gods and Death. To punish him, the Gods condemned him to push a boulder uphill forever, only for it to roll back each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a287539e31ccb52ea0eaee0f8b4a0115.poster.avif?t=1758050453\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a287539e31ccb52ea0eaee0f8b4a0115.webm?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a287539e31ccb52ea0eaee0f8b4a0115.mp4?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But Sisyphus didn't give up. He decided to livestream it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/b1b8115cdab8cec742c35a621b766811.poster.avif?t=1758050453\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/b1b8115cdab8cec742c35a621b766811.webm?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/b1b8115cdab8cec742c35a621b766811.mp4?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine Sisyphus Happy is a fast-paced clicker + QTE game about life, spectacle, and finding meaning in repetition. Roll your boulder, pull off stunts, and try to make the eternal grind worth living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a519bc5bb25e3569d7a4070bfb61d09e.poster.avif?t=1758050453\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a519bc5bb25e3569d7a4070bfb61d09e.webm?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a519bc5bb25e3569d7a4070bfb61d09e.mp4?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push the boulder. Do tricks. Go live.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/5138e61cd77bb5c4986b63c0ee57a84f.poster.avif?t=1758050453\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/5138e61cd77bb5c4986b63c0ee57a84f.apng?t=1758050453\" class=\"bb_img\" width=240 height=240 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/6364d9a402bd402cb8af705e21d34ffc.poster.avif?t=1758050453\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/6364d9a402bd402cb8af705e21d34ffc.apng?t=1758050453\" class=\"bb_img\" width=240 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressing from Greek myth to the modern day, the story asks two simple questions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aren\u2019t you a Sisyphus too?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you Imagine Sisyphus Happy?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/1b202c2638bbc017b91a1052b476f46a.poster.avif?t=1758050453\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/1b202c2638bbc017b91a1052b476f46a.webm?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/1b202c2638bbc017b91a1052b476f46a.mp4?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pushing your boulder for eternity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making tricks with a wild combo of Cliker and Quick-Time-Event</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming your struggle and interacting with a live chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Going through the ages and modern scenarios, looking for your boulder to push</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding joy and happiness in a meaningless grind of life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full release in Q1 2026 will have:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More tricks, with trick chains and combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More relatable context, where you can find your very own boulder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large Quick-Time-Event variety, mimicking the contexts of the boulder you push</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A more realistic simulated streamer economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eternal grind split into short sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shop with cosmetic upgrades (not for real money, of course - no in-game purchases)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959020?t=1758050453","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/edfc697dbf2f7fcf881ae5d7d66c4f30e94c3cee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758050453","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/82f0b7381d66e01f5161592b48a27931f688b861/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758050453","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/82f0b7381d66e01f5161592b48a27931f688b861/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758050453","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe struggle itself toward the heights is enough to fill a human\u2019s heart. One must imagine Sisyphus happy.\u201d</i> \u2013 Albert Camus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sisyphus, king of Corinth, has tricked the Gods and Death. To punish him, the Gods condemned him to push a boulder uphill forever, only for it to roll back each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a287539e31ccb52ea0eaee0f8b4a0115.poster.avif?t=1758050453\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a287539e31ccb52ea0eaee0f8b4a0115.webm?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a287539e31ccb52ea0eaee0f8b4a0115.mp4?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But Sisyphus didn't give up. He decided to livestream it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/b1b8115cdab8cec742c35a621b766811.poster.avif?t=1758050453\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/b1b8115cdab8cec742c35a621b766811.webm?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/b1b8115cdab8cec742c35a621b766811.mp4?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine Sisyphus Happy is a fast-paced clicker + QTE game about life, spectacle, and finding meaning in repetition. Roll your boulder, pull off stunts, and try to make the eternal grind worth living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a519bc5bb25e3569d7a4070bfb61d09e.poster.avif?t=1758050453\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a519bc5bb25e3569d7a4070bfb61d09e.webm?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/extras/a519bc5bb25e3569d7a4070bfb61d09e.mp4?t=1758050453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push the boulder. Do tricks. Go live.</strong></p><p class=\"b