"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pushing your boulder for eternity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making tricks with a wild combo of Cliker and Quick-Time-Event</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming your struggle and interacting with a live chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Going through the ages and modern scenarios, looking for your boulder to push</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding joy and happiness in a meaningless grind of life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full release in Q1 2026 will have:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More tricks, with trick chains and combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More relatable context, where you can find your very own boulder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large Quick-Time-Event variety, mimicking the contexts of the boulder you push</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A more realistic simulated streamer economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eternal grind split into short sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shop with cosmetic upgrades (not for real money, of course - no in-game purchases)</p></li></ul>","developers":["UnplayTheGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959020/c25a7b748c264f492d1b6853daab42d10d2e33e8/header.jpg?t=1758050453","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 (or equivalent 64\u2011bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3\u20113220 / AMD FX\u20116300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 or better</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul cla